  "name": "DAHD4: Python Conversion of Data-Adaptive Harmonic Decomposition",
  "description": "Python conversion of the DAHD (Data-Adaptive Harmonic Decomposition) MATLAB codebase developed for NSF-funded Arctic sea ice forecasting research. Includes full spectral decomposition pipeline, space-time DAHM computation, harmonic reconstruction, and multi-level stochastic Stuart-Landau model (MSLM) forecasting. Validated against original MATLAB output with documented bug fixes and RMSE verification.",
